om2
note hoisted loop constants survive scrub in the loop body: the global addresses of a and b and the
note number 5000 sit in x20.. while scrub zeroes X18-X26; the body must reload them (exit 168)
global a ulong 16
global b ulong 16
fn main to int
for i ulong 16
put b i i
end
for i ulong 16
k = scrub 32
put a i add get b i 5000
end
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 16
s = add s sub get a i 5000
end
ret int and add s 48 255
end
